stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Running

    state "Active Expedition (Host authority)" as Running {
        [*] --> CoreObjective
        CoreObjective --> Zone2Objective : TryCompleteCoreObjective accepted
        Zone2Objective --> Zone3FindFrigate : Zone 2 completion accepted
        Zone3FindFrigate --> Zone3PushFrigate : authorized frigate push begins
        Zone3PushFrigate --> FinalHunt : zone 3 charge completed
        FinalHunt --> Escape : valid exit interaction / phase advance
    }

    Running --> MatchEnded : TryEndMatch(result, reason, actor)
    MatchEnded --> [*]

    note right of Zone2Objective
        Security terminal, relays and authorization
        are internal Zone 2 stages in the main online route.
        Puzzle and SecurityHold also exist in the enum,
        but are not forced into this chosen main path.
    end note

    note right of Escape
        SciFi Doorexit may advance FinalHunt to Escape
        and then resolve the match in the same interaction.
        Escape need not be a long-running screen.
    end note

    note right of MatchEnded
        Phase = MatchEnded; Status = Ended.
        Result = Win or Lose is a separate enum.
        Timeouts may resolve Win if someone already escaped.
    end note
